    {
      "source": "First ensures that the given value is coerceable into the type expected by this option, then returns the result of\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object.toString()</code></a> called on the given value. If this option is escaping quotes (<a href=\"Option.html#escapesValue()\"><code>Option.escapesValue()</code></a> is\n<code>true</code>), then single quotes will be escaped, and if this option is quoting values ( <a href=\"Option.html#quotesValue()\"><code>Option.quotesValue()</code></a> is\n<code>true</code>), then the value will be surrounded by single quotes. Given null, returns an empty string.",
      "translation": "首先确保给定值可转换为该选项所期望的类型，然后返回在给定值上调用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object.toString()</code></a>的结果。如果此选项启用引号转义（即<a href=\"Option.html#escapesValue()\"><code>Option.escapesValue()</code></a>为<code>true</code>），则单引号将被转义；如果此选项启用值引用（即<a href=\"Option.html#quotesValue()\"><code>Option.quotesValue()</code></a>为<code>true</code>），则值将用单引号包围。若给定值为 null，则返回空字符串。",
      "count": 1
    },
